      { "id": "headphones-neck-shot", "kind": "image", "title": "图片8", "x": 1070, "y": 45, "width": 300, "content": "@[node:headphones-product] 参考产品带到 @[node:headphones-full-model] 正面面对镜头，只露出鼻子以下的部分，身体半身，突出产品戴在脖子上的效果，背景为冷调影棚", "version": 1, "createdAt": 9, "imageWidth": 1024, "imageHeight": 1024, "imageAutoSize": true, "imageCount": 1 },
      { "id": "headphones-typography", "kind": "image", "title": "图片9", "x": 1070, "y": 466, "width": 300, "content": "@[node:headphones-poster] 在冷灰渐变高级背景、柔和环绕影棚光下，产品保持正面没有任何效果，产品左边字体为 Sounds，右边字体为 of Nature，字体要灰色简约风格", "version": 1, "createdAt": 10, "imageWidth": 1024, "imageHeight": 1024, "imageAutoSize": true, "imageCount": 1 },
