      { "id": "headphones-video", "kind": "video", "title": "视频素材", "x": 1520, "y": 45, "width": 300, "content": "开始2秒产品展示，然后产品 @[node:headphones-poster] 进行旋转，带旋转音效，然后切换镜头 @[node:headphones-logo-detail] @[node:headphones-earpad-detail] @[node:headphones-band-detail]，共计三秒的镜头，配效果音效；转场到 @[node:headphones-neck-shot]，中景效果人物自然衔接到 @[node:headphones-wearing]，时长3秒；自然转场到 @[node:headphones-listening]，主角享受听歌的感觉；最后 @[node:headphones-typography] 缓慢出现2秒，画面定格，专业广告配音 Get Heavenly Voices Instantly", "version": 1, "createdAt": 12, "videoAspectWidth": 16, "videoAspectHeight": 9, "videoAutoSize": true, "videoDuration": 5, "videoResolution": 720 },
